## Interface: 16001
## Title: Buff Reminder
## Notes: Warns when your class buffs are missing or expire, with a click-to-cast row of the missing ones. Choose which buffs to watch, per class.
## Category: Combat
## IconAtlas: transmog-icon-warning-small
## Author: brinuz
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: BuffReminderDB
## X-License: GPL-3.0-or-later
## AddonCompartmentFunc: BuffReminder_OnAddonCompartmentClick

# Files load in this order, each receiving (addonName, ns) as its `...`.
# Core first: the shared table, saved settings and events. Buffs is the data
# the rest reads.
Core.lua
Buffs.lua
Watch.lua
# Bar.lua defines the mixin Bar.xml's frames name, so it loads first.
Bar.lua
Bar.xml
Settings.lua
